    1                      ;=============================================================================
    2                      ;  10_branches -- every branch and jump, both outcomes, and the ID condition
    3                      ;=============================================================================
    4                      ;  Checklist: D1 (beqz/bnez/bltz/blez/bgtz/bgez against a negative, a zero and
    5                      ;  a positive operand -- 18 outcomes), D2 (j / jal / jr / jalr and the link
    6                      ;  value), D10 (the branch operand produced 1, 2 and 3 instructions earlier),
    7                      ;  D11 (back-to-back taken branches), plus a backward loop.
    8                      ;
    9                      ;  Prediction behaviour is 11_btb_predictor's job.  Here each branch is
   10                      ;  executed once, so every one of them is a BTB cold miss.
   11                      ;
   12                      ;  The shape of a case is always the same four instructions:
   13                      ;        addi r10, r0, 1      ; assume taken
   14                      ;        b??  rX, L
   15                      ;        addi r10, r0, 0      ; only reached when NOT taken
   16                      ;    L:  sw   N(r0), r10
   17                      ;  so every result word is 1 for taken and 0 for not taken.
   18                      ;
   19                      ;  Result map (word : branch / operand):
   20                      ;     0 beqz -5   1 beqz 0   2 beqz +5      3 bnez -5   4 bnez 0   5 bnez +5
   21                      ;     6 bltz -5   7 bltz 0   8 bltz +5      9 blez -5  10 blez 0  11 blez +5
   22                      ;    12 bgtz -5  13 bgtz 0  14 bgtz +5     15 bgez -5  16 bgez 0  17 bgez +5
   23                      ;    18 condition at distance 1   19 at distance 3   20 at distance 4
   24                      ;    21 backward loop trip count  22 jal link    23 reached past j
   25                      ;    24 jalr link                 25 jalr callee ran     26 back-to-back
   26                      ;=============================================================================
